request.description:
Compliance officer records manual review outcome for a REVIEW decision.

Request: ReviewOutcomeRequest {
  reviewerId: UUID (required),
  outcome: String (CONFIRMED_FRAUD | CLEARED | ESCALATED, required),
  notes: String (optional)
}

Response 200: { decisionId, outcome, reviewedAt }
Response 409: ProblemDetail if decision not found or already reviewed

Note: If outcome is CONFIRMED_FRAUD, the source account is automatically flagged in Redis.

Record that a Suspicious Activity Report (SAR) was filed. Regulatory compliance requirement.

Request: SarFilingRequest { sarReference: String (required) }

Response 200: { decisionId, sarReference, sarFiledAt }
Response 404: ProblemDetail if decision not found
